# CQ-B4 — Is the legitimate-interests basis excluded for public authorities acting in their
# tasks, and what does that exclusion attach to?
# Probe (frozen CQ-B4): 6(1)(f) 2nd sentence (final subparagraph) as a LegalEffect/Exception on
# the basis (LegalBasisLegitimateInterests).
#
# Regime: plain (matches the asserted gdprkg:hasException edge directly).
#
# MODELLING NOTE (SURFACE-F): implemented as an Exception attached via gdprkg:hasException to
# ex:basis-legitimate-interests, grounded in the 6(1) final subparagraph (ex:art6-p1-final).
# Whether Exception vs a scoping-Condition is the right construct is surfaced, not decided.
#
# Expected over art6.ttl: 1 row —
#   ex:basis-legitimate-interests -> ex:exc-6-1-f-public-authority (@ ex:art6-p1-final)
PREFIX gdprkg: <https://w3id.org/gdprkg#>
SELECT ?basis ?exception ?groundedIn
WHERE {
  ?basis a gdprkg:LegalBasisLegitimateInterests ;
         gdprkg:hasException ?exception .
  ?exception gdprkg:groundedIn ?groundedIn .
}
